---
alwaysApply: true
---
Assume the following environment variables are set in a file named .env at the root of the project:
Variables without an equals sign are set but hidden to you.

# AWS Credentials
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_SESSION_TOKEN
AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK

OPENAI_API_KEY
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
BEDROCK_MODEL=amazon.nova-micro-v1:0

# Langsmith
LANGSMITH_API_KEY
LANGSMITH_TRACING="true"
LANGSMITH_ENDPOINT="https://api.smith.langchain.com"
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=""

# ChromaDB Configuration
CHROMA_PC_PATH=./chroma_db
ALLOW_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
# NEXT_JS
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://backend:8000